message: "If you use Strata in your learning or research, please cite it as:"
title: "Strata — Software Engineering Knowledge & Agent Context Layer"
abstract: >-
  Standards-grounded, evidence-tiered knowledge base for software engineering
  (SWEBOK v4.0, CS2023, ISO/IEC 25010:2023, ISO/IEC/IEEE 12207, CMMI V3.0) with a
  progressive-disclosure agent harness for validating understanding, spaced-retrieval
  learning, and a local-first journey layer.
keywords:
  - software engineering
  - knowledge base
  - agent harness
  - evidence-based learning
  - spaced repetition
  - system design
